1\. The Domino Effect

Small actions can trigger larger results when performed in the right sequence. You don't need to achieve everything today; you need to complete the right first step.

Example: Practicing Python fundamentals consistently makes it easier to solve DSA problems, build projects, and prepare for technical interviews.

